@startuml 50-firesky-output-flow
' Where a run's Output goes: owner-authenticated reveal (reveal_output.rs) and
' the bounded social reply to F1r3sky (run_on_firesky.rs).
title From a run's Output to F1r3sky — reveal and social reply
skinparam backgroundColor #F8FBFF
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam ArrowColor #294C60
skinparam sequence {
  ParticipantBackgroundColor #EAF5FF
  ParticipantBorderColor #38789E
  LifeLineBorderColor #6A92AA
  GroupBackgroundColor #FFF3E8
  GroupBorderColor #D97638
}

actor "Run owner\n(wallet holder)" as Own #FFD8C2
participant "embers\n(agents-teams)" as E #CDEACC
participant "F1r3drive\nstore" as S #E8DACB
participant "Validator\n(ledger)" as V #FFE4A6
participant "PDS / F1r3sky\n(ATProto)" as P #E1D5E7

== precondition — the run completed ==
E -> S : put Output artifact (encrypted)
E -> V : terminal advance_run\n(commits output content/capability hashes only)

group owner-authenticated reveal — reveal_output.rs
  Own -> E : prepare reveal (run_id)
  E -> S : locate Output artifact\n(store-drift check before signing)
  E --> Own : claimOutputReveal contract\n(fresh reveal_id)
  Own -> E : send (locally signed)
  E -> V : deploy claimOutputReveal
  note right of V #FFF0C7
    The ledger scrubs owner from every read, so authorization
    is on-chain only: the clause appends an actor-less
    outputRevealed event iff the signer owns the run.
  end note
  V --> E : finalized + new outputRevealed event
  alt a new event appeared
    E -> S : get Output artifact, AEAD-decrypt
    S --> E : output value
    E --> Own : the decrypted output (single-use, INV-S2)
  else no new event (replay, or ledger predates the clause)
    E --> Own : Consumed — fail closed, no disclosure (INV-S3)
  end
end

group bounded social reply — run_on_firesky.rs
  E -> E : transform Output to a post\n(text, or upload an image URL as a blob)
  E -> P : create_record — thread reply\n(≤ 280 chars + "Run: <url>")
end

note over E, P #FFF0C7
  Publishing the team definition to F1r3sky is a separate flow with its
  own Draft→Published→PublishedStale→Unpublished lifecycle (diagram 35).
end note

@enduml
